 Hochul raising about $16.6 million to Blakeman's $13.4 million, though the incumbent holds more cash entering the final month.\n\nAnalysts across the spectrum rate the race Solid or Safe Democratic, and prediction markets put Hochul's win chances around 96 to 98 percent. Signs of a closer contest, including Trump's planned Syracuse rally, both candidates campaigning in Erie County, and narrower margins in Republican-sponsored polls, suggest Blakeman can keep it competitive. But his sparse policy detail and the state's blue tilt leave him a clear underdog.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9859, "margin": 12.77}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9584, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9776, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9779, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9761, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9756, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9778, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9755, "margin": 11.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9799, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9796, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9804, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9807, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9805, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9817, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9754, "margin": 11.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9752, "margin": 11.5}]}